{"success":true,"html":"<h1 class=\"card-title\">Giam C\u1ea7m T\u00ean B\u1ea1o Qu\u00e2n Ph\u1ea3n Di\u1ec7n - Ch\u01b0\u01a1ng 2.<\/h1>\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"chapter_id\" id=\"chapter_id\" value=\"373363\">\n\n\n<p class=\"bg-light-info p-3 radius-10 mt-3\">\n    C\u1eadp nh\u1eadt l\u00fac: 2026-11-07 06:31:14<br>\n    L\u01b0\u1ee3t xem: 231 <br>\n<\/p>\n\n<div class=\"chapter-content\">\n    <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"chapter_id\" id=\"chapter_id\" value=\"373363\">\n    <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"chapter_title\" id=\"chapter_title\" value=\"Ch\u01b0\u01a1ng 2.\">\n    <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"story_id\" id=\"story_id\" value=\"8414\">\n    <div class=\"content-container mt-4\" id=\"chapter-content-render\">\n                                                                    <div class=\"actcl\" style=\" display:block; \">\n                        <p class=\"text-center\" style=\"font-size: 16px;margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\">M\u1eddi Qu\u00fd \u0111\u1ed9c gi\u1ea3 <b>CLICK<\/b> v\u00e0o <b class=\"text-uppercase\">li\u00ean k\u1ebft ho\u1eb7c \u1ea3nh<\/b> b\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi<\/p>\n                        <p class=\"text-center\" style=\"font-size: 16px;margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\"><span class=\"text-uppercase text-danger\"><b>m\u1edf \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee<\/b><\/span>, sau \u0111\u00f3 quay tr\u1edf l\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c \u0111\u1ecdc to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 ch\u01b0\u01a1ng truy\u1ec7n!<\/p>\n                        <p class=\"text-center\" style=\"font-size: 16px;margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\"><a id=\"affLink\" href=\"https:\/\/s.shopee.vn\/7fThPlOpWf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"affLinkClick()\"><b>https:\/\/s.shopee.vn\/7fThPlOpWf<\/b><\/a><\/p>\n                        <p class=\"text-center\" style=\"font-size: 16px;margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\">\n                            <a href=\"https:\/\/s.shopee.vn\/7fThPlOpWf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"affLinkClick()\">\n                                <img src=\"https:\/\/dammyy.cc\/images\/click-here-to-unlock.webp\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width: 410px; width: 100%;\">\n                            <\/a>\n                        <\/p>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-center text-primary\" style=\"font-size: 20px;margin: 1rem 0;\">\u0110am M\u1ef9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 T\u00e1c gi\u1ea3\/Editor xin ch\u00e2n th\u00e0nh c\u1ea3m \u01a1n!<\/h4>\n                    <\/div>\n                    <div class=\"actac\" style=\" display:none; \">\n                        <!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-\/\/W3C\/\/DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional\/\/EN\" \"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/TR\/REC-html40\/loose.dtd\">\n<p>&ldquo;An Vi&#7877;n H&#7847;u <span class=\"q-40d8e30f716847735d39156962b2d222\"><\/span> s&#7899;m <span class=\"y-2cf8582475dfb150654494f2255fadcb\"><\/span> <span class=\"b-a2e24f318c955cbb09c0da49a4382027\"><\/span> trong l&ograve;ng, hai <span class=\"b-a2e24f318c955cbb09c0da49a4382027\"><\/span> h&#7885; t&igrave;nh &#273;&#7847;u &yacute; h&#7907;p, ch&#7859;ng m&#7845;y ch&#7889;c s&#7869; tr&#7903; th&agrave;nh phu th&ecirc;. Huynh c&#7847;n g&igrave; <span class=\"o-f38a8d70c931cd2181f39edb40684d61\"><\/span> chia r&#7869; uy&ecirc;n &#432;&#417;ng, t&#7921; chu&#7889;c l&#7845;y m&#7845;t m&#7863;t?&rdquo;<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ta h&#7887;i ng&#432;&#7907;c <span class=\"m-b40587bae4b414a9ad8227e5eb79a329\"><\/span>:<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>&ldquo;Tr&#7851;m l&agrave; ho&agrave;ng &#273;&#7871;, ch&#7859;ng l&#7869; ngay c&#7843; h&ocirc;n s&#7921; c&#7911;a m&#7897;t th&#7847;n t.&#7917; c&#361;ng <span class=\"x-41f1d789771b6c968fcc1d63840edfc0\"><\/span> th&#7875; quy&#7871;t &#273;&#7883;nh?&rdquo;<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>&ldquo;Ho&agrave;ng <span class=\"u-0892a8d4c06115a5f40449cc06ac4310\"><\/span>, <span class=\"u-0892a8d4c06115a5f40449cc06ac4310\"><\/span> <span class=\"q-40d8e30f716847735d39156962b2d222\"><\/span> <span class=\"y-2cf8582475dfb150654494f2255fadcb\"><\/span> tam cung l&#7909;c vi&#7879;n, t&#7841;i <span class=\"s-53e7ca3ac800c85fb2f52dd652b46536\"><\/span> c&#7913; nh&#7845;t quy&#7871;t tr&ecirc;u ch&#7885;c An Vi&#7877;n H&#7847;u? Huynh <span class=\"y-2cf8582475dfb150654494f2255fadcb\"><\/span> <span class=\"k-5c0675052615b655fc7997ee8ba6eb75\"><\/span> c&agrave;ng &eacute;p <span class=\"o-516fa50e42b169126d3b3aaf8301f80c\"><\/span> &#273;&#7871;n &#273;&#432;&#7901;ng c&ugrave;ng, <span class=\"o-516fa50e42b169126d3b3aaf8301f80c\"><\/span> c&agrave;ng xem <span class=\"u-0892a8d4c06115a5f40449cc06ac4310\"><\/span> ch&#7859;ng kh&aacute;c n&agrave;o th&#7913; r&aacute;c r&#432;&#7903;i, ch&#7881; <span class=\"j-93a75fa0bfabb27ec147380355e89b31\"><\/span> v&#7913;t b&#7887; <span class=\"e-7f99b3769115e9fbc276758421df4504\"><\/span> <span class=\"x-41f1d789771b6c968fcc1d63840edfc0\"><\/span>?&rdquo;<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ta <span class=\"x-41f1d789771b6c968fcc1d63840edfc0\"><\/span> <span class=\"i-1fd7c953c1de569aa125c47a110584d6\"><\/span>.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ngay l&uacute;c <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> ph&#7845;t tay, chu&#7849;n <span class=\"z-0ebe739a7539a0e44726b3aac2bad2b1\"><\/span> ban h&ocirc;n, Ti&#7871;t Linh &#272;&igrave;nh kho&aacute;c m&#7897;t <span class=\"z-5b86c9d1b53fc1b6246864f9056fdf31\"><\/span> huy&#7873;n y, t&#7921;a nh&#432; m&agrave;n &#273;&ecirc;m u &aacute;m bao ph&#7911; &aacute;nh tr&#259;ng l&#7841;nh, ung dung b&#432;&#7899;c <span class=\"p-d0e56dcd6145b0c521de81e415da7c5d\"><\/span>.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>H&#7855;n th&#7859;ng th&#7915;ng b&#432;&#7899;c qua L&yacute; C&agrave;n, &#7889;ng tay &aacute;o r&#7897;ng m&agrave;u &#273;en th&ecirc;u ch&#7881; v&agrave;ng kh&#7869; l&#432;&#7899;t qua b&ecirc;n m&aacute; L&yacute; C&agrave;n.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>L&yacute; C&agrave;n r&otilde; r&agrave;ng <span class=\"q-40d8e30f716847735d39156962b2d222\"><\/span> y&ecirc;n t&acirc;m h&#417;n, d&aacute;ng <span class=\"b-a2e24f318c955cbb09c0da49a4382027\"><\/span> c&#361;ng th&#7843; l&#7887;ng h&#7859;n.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>H&#7855;n l&uacute;c n&agrave;o c&#361;ng nh&#432; <span class=\"b-1047e622bcc6a215de383d9eac22ad35\"><\/span>, r&otilde; r&agrave;ng <span class=\"k-5c0675052615b655fc7997ee8ba6eb75\"><\/span> <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> ch&aacute;n gh&eacute;t vi&#7879;c <span class=\"o-516fa50e42b169126d3b3aaf8301f80c\"><\/span> &#273;&#7889;i x&#7917; <span class=\"u-8a4b73709b8ecfc290df345a2c464ce8\"><\/span> v&#7899;i L&yacute; C&agrave;n, nh&#432;ng <span class=\"e-a6ee35b4f3eeb6aba6f454e2e8337fd4\"><\/span> bao gi&#7901; ch&#7883;u n&eacute; tr&aacute;nh <span class=\"e-7f99b3769115e9fbc276758421df4504\"><\/span> ki&ecirc;ng d&egrave;.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ta v&#7889;n l&agrave; k&#7867; nh&#7887; nhen, b&#7909;ng <span class=\"c-c9ab64499be7853a2f01b43c8de63581\"><\/span> h&#7865;p h&ograve;i. Th&#7871; nh&#432;ng c&ograve;n <span class=\"e-a6ee35b4f3eeb6aba6f454e2e8337fd4\"><\/span> k&#7883;p l&agrave;m kh&oacute;, Ti&#7871;t Linh &#272;&igrave;nh <span class=\"q-40d8e30f716847735d39156962b2d222\"><\/span> b&#432;&#7899;c &#273;&#7871;n <span class=\"j-1feb7ff16ef94c8547de63f1ab3f0723\"><\/span> m&#7863;t <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span>.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Nh&#7919;ng ng&oacute;n tay thon d&agrave;i, kh&#7899;p x&#432;&#417;ng r&otilde; r&agrave;ng nh&#432; <span class=\"r-70db15f955a0d3a4cfa430cd19570962\"><\/span> t&#7841;c t&#7915; ng&#7885;c l&#432;&#7899;t qua m&aacute; tr&aacute;i c&#7911;a <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span>, d&#7915;ng <span class=\"m-b40587bae4b414a9ad8227e5eb79a329\"><\/span> &#273;&ocirc;i ch&uacute;t <span class=\"j-7f9e2c8a50e8629596894c7a79f2b411\"><\/span> v&#7871;t s&#7865;o d&#7919; t&#7907;n, <span class=\"h-51797a6449b77936b9b37232cb623c41\"><\/span> &#273;&oacute; ch&#7853;m r&atilde;i tr&#432;&#7907;t sang b&ecirc;n, qu&#7845;n l&#7845;y nh&#7919;ng l&#7885;n t&oacute;c bu&ocirc;ng x&otilde;a c&#7911;a <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span>.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>&#272;&#7897;ng t&aacute;c ch&#7859;ng h&#7873; d&#7883;u d&agrave;ng. H&#7855;n t&uacute;m l&#7845;y t&oacute;c <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span>, <span class=\"b-4401c28a16b06f4565af51c37ed423dc\"><\/span> th&ocirc; b&#7841;o k&eacute;o <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> &#273;&#7871;n <span class=\"j-1feb7ff16ef94c8547de63f1ab3f0723\"><\/span> m&#7863;t <span class=\"x-41327d5f93ec80958d58847dcbcf4cd7\"><\/span>.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>&ldquo;Du&#7879; V&#432;&#417;ng &#273;i&#7879;n h&#7841; m&#7899;i m&#432;&#7901;i b&#7889;n tu&#7893;i, b&#7879; h&#7841; <span class=\"q-40d8e30f716847735d39156962b2d222\"><\/span> n&oacute;ng l&ograve;ng ban h&ocirc;n &#273;&#7871;n <span class=\"b-1047e622bcc6a215de383d9eac22ad35\"><\/span> <span class=\"s-53e7ca3ac800c85fb2f52dd652b46536\"><\/span>?&rdquo;<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>H&#7855;n v&#7889;n lu&ocirc;n gi&#7887;i che gi&#7845;u c&#7843;m x&uacute;c, ch&#7859;ng bao gi&#7901; &#273;&#7875; l&#7897; vui bu&#7891;n <span class=\"j-7f9e2c8a50e8629596894c7a79f2b411\"><\/span> m&#7863;t. Ch&#7881; khi chuy&#7879;n <span class=\"y-2cf8582475dfb150654494f2255fadcb\"><\/span> li&ecirc;n quan &#273;&#7871;n L&yacute; C&agrave;n, <span class=\"o-516fa50e42b169126d3b3aaf8301f80c\"><\/span> m&#7899;i &#273;&ocirc;i ch&uacute;t m&#7845;t ki&#7875;m so&aacute;t.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ta m&#7881;m <span class=\"n-397510de0d2de26bb6a79e002dcb6ffd\"><\/span>.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>&ldquo;B&acirc;y gi&#7901; ban h&ocirc;n v&#7851;n c&ograve;n k&#7883;p, H&#7847;u gia c&#361;ng <span class=\"y-2cf8582475dfb150654494f2255fadcb\"><\/span> th&#7875; c&ugrave;ng n&agrave;ng nh&#7853;n l&#7901;i ch&uacute;c m&#7915;ng c&#7911;a b&aacute; quan v&#259;n v&otilde;.&rdquo;<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>M&#7845;y ng&agrave;y <span class=\"j-1feb7ff16ef94c8547de63f1ab3f0723\"><\/span>, Ti&#7871;t Linh &#272;&igrave;nh &#273;&#432;a v&#7873; t&#7915; chi&#7871;n tr&#432;&#7901;ng m&#7897;t c&ocirc; nhi. H&#7855;n <span class=\"t-22d7b891db2d67b61f5453c5ac913e88\"><\/span> n&agrave;ng l&agrave; <span class=\"b-a2e24f318c955cbb09c0da49a4382027\"><\/span> quen c&#361; thu&#7903; thi&#7871;u th&#7901;i, hai <span class=\"b-a2e24f318c955cbb09c0da49a4382027\"><\/span> t&igrave;nh c&#7901; g&#7863;p <span class=\"m-b40587bae4b414a9ad8227e5eb79a329\"><\/span> <span class=\"d-b482a76846120f4cc7798e57c23f007e\"><\/span>. Khi <span class=\"o-516fa50e42b169126d3b3aaf8301f80c\"><\/span> <span class=\"z-0ebe739a7539a0e44726b3aac2bad2b1\"><\/span> tr&#7885;ng th&#432;&#417;ng, n&agrave;ng <span class=\"q-40d8e30f716847735d39156962b2d222\"><\/span> t&#7853;n t&igrave;nh ch&#259;m s&oacute;c, l&acirc;u ng&agrave;y sinh t&igrave;nh, n&ecirc;n <span class=\"j-93a75fa0bfabb27ec147380355e89b31\"><\/span> xin <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> ban h&ocirc;n.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ta b&#7921;c b&#7897;i <span class=\"x-41f1d789771b6c968fcc1d63840edfc0\"><\/span> th&ocirc;i, th&#7871; l&agrave; &#273;em L&yacute; C&agrave;n <span class=\"n-51911a0eb08b96c08c5ec03f0feb469f\"><\/span> tr&uacute;t gi&#7853;n.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ti&#7871;t Linh &#272;&igrave;nh v&#7851;n b&igrave;nh th&#7843;n, <span class=\"x-41f1d789771b6c968fcc1d63840edfc0\"><\/span> ki&ecirc;u ng&#7841;o c&#361;ng ch&#7859;ng h&egrave;n m&#7885;n.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>&ldquo;Th&#7847;n <span class=\"q-40d8e30f716847735d39156962b2d222\"><\/span> hai m&#432;&#417;i b&#7843;y tu&#7893;i, t&#7893; m&#7851;u &#7903; nh&agrave; ng&agrave;y &#273;&ecirc;m mong ng&oacute;ng, ch&#7881; hy v&#7885;ng th&#7847;n s&#7899;m <span class=\"y-2cf8582475dfb150654494f2255fadcb\"><\/span> <span class=\"b-a2e24f318c955cbb09c0da49a4382027\"><\/span> n&#7889;i d&otilde;i. B&#7879; h&#7841; l&#7845;y hi&#7871;u &#273;&#7841;o tr&#7883; thi&ecirc;n h&#7841;, ch&#7859;ng l&#7869; <span class=\"m-b40587bae4b414a9ad8227e5eb79a329\"><\/span> <span class=\"j-93a75fa0bfabb27ec147380355e89b31\"><\/span> th&#7847;n &#273;o&#7841;n tuy&#7879;t h&#432;&#417;ng h&#7887;a, khi&#7871;n t&#7893; m&#7851;u <span class=\"o-f38a8d70c931cd2181f39edb40684d61\"><\/span> &ocirc;m ti&#7871;c nu&#7889;i?&rdquo;<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>H&#7855;n n&#7917;a <span class=\"n-397510de0d2de26bb6a79e002dcb6ffd\"><\/span> n&#7917;a <span class=\"x-41f1d789771b6c968fcc1d63840edfc0\"><\/span>, ng&oacute;n tay ch&#7853;m r&atilde;i tr&#432;&#7907;t xu&#7889;ng, &#7845;n l&ecirc;n b&#7909;ng <span class=\"a-e13879c6dd4aa01692114c84b9a753c4\"><\/span> c&#7911;a <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span>, &#273;&#7891;ng th&#7901;i gh&eacute; s&aacute;t tai <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span>.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>&ldquo;Hay l&agrave; b&#7879; h&#7841; cho r&#7857;ng, v&#7899;i <span class=\"z-5b86c9d1b53fc1b6246864f9056fdf31\"><\/span> nam nhi c&#7911;a <span class=\"x-41327d5f93ec80958d58847dcbcf4cd7\"><\/span>, c&#361;ng <span class=\"y-2cf8582475dfb150654494f2255fadcb\"><\/span> th&#7875; gi&uacute;p th&#7847;n n&#7889;i d&otilde;i t&ocirc;ng &#273;&#432;&#7901;ng?&rdquo;<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>6<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"signature\">H&#7891;ng Tr&agrave; Kem Cheese<\/p><p>Ta <span class=\"f-1a13203057dfcfbbba884098049e91c2\"><\/span> <span class=\"o-f38a8d70c931cd2181f39edb40684d61\"><\/span> <span class=\"b-a2e24f318c955cbb09c0da49a4382027\"><\/span> l&#432;&#7905;ng t&iacute;nh, &#273;&#7901;i <span class=\"u-f86b6c2a36b11ac82469206c7551161f\"><\/span> c&#361;ng ch&#7859;ng th&#7875; sinh con.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Y&ecirc;u c&#7847;u c&#7911;a <span class=\"o-516fa50e42b169126d3b3aaf8301f80c\"><\/span> v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng h&#7907;p t&igrave;nh h&#7907;p l&yacute;, khi&#7871;n <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> <span class=\"x-41f1d789771b6c968fcc1d63840edfc0\"><\/span> th&#7875; ph&#7843;n b&aacute;c.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>C&oacute; &#273;i&#7873;u, n&#7871;u <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> d&#7877; d&agrave;ng th&#7887;a hi&#7879;p nh&#432; <span class=\"b-1047e622bcc6a215de383d9eac22ad35\"><\/span> th&igrave; <span class=\"q-40d8e30f716847735d39156962b2d222\"><\/span> ch&#7859;ng <span class=\"z-0ebe739a7539a0e44726b3aac2bad2b1\"><\/span> <span class=\"b-a2e24f318c955cbb09c0da49a4382027\"><\/span> &#273;&#7901;i g&#7885;i l&agrave; b&#7841;o qu&acirc;n.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ta h&#7841; l&#7879;nh &#273;&#432;a n&#7919; t.&#7917; s&#7855;p tr&#7903; th&agrave;nh H&#7847;u phu nh&acirc;n <span class=\"p-d0e56dcd6145b0c521de81e415da7c5d\"><\/span> cung, <span class=\"t-22d7b891db2d67b61f5453c5ac913e88\"><\/span> r&#7857;ng <span class=\"j-93a75fa0bfabb27ec147380355e89b31\"><\/span> &#273;&iacute;ch <span class=\"z-5b86c9d1b53fc1b6246864f9056fdf31\"><\/span> g&#7863;p m&#7863;t n&agrave;ng.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>V&#7889;n t&#432;&#7903;ng &#273;&oacute; s&#7869; l&agrave; m&#7897;t th&ocirc;n n&#7919; y&#7871;u &#273;u&#7889;i, nh&uacute;t nh&aacute;t, run r&#7849;y nh&#432; ch&uacute; g&agrave; con &#273;&aacute;ng th&#432;&#417;ng.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Kh&ocirc;ng ng&#7901;, n&agrave;ng <span class=\"m-b40587bae4b414a9ad8227e5eb79a329\"><\/span> ki&ecirc;u h&atilde;nh t&#7921;a c&agrave;nh mai &#273;&#7887; gi&#7919;a tr&#7901;i tuy&#7871;t, &aacute;nh m&#7855;t ki&ecirc;n ngh&#7883;, qu&#7843; quy&#7871;t ch&#7859;ng kh&aacute;c n&agrave;o Ti&#7871;t Linh &#272;&igrave;nh.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ta h&#7887;i:<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>&ldquo;T&ecirc;n g&igrave;?&rdquo;<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>N&agrave;ng <span class=\"w-a7342bfd4c9c760774093f0f68f97eed\"><\/span> gi&#7919;a &#273;&#7841;i &#273;i&#7879;n, th&#7859;ng th&#7855;n <span class=\"j-ce42180f29cf1c8c0329f7f8101cb7a1\"><\/span> <span class=\"p-d0e56dcd6145b0c521de81e415da7c5d\"><\/span> m&#7855;t <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span>.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>&ldquo;A T&ugrave;y.&rdquo;<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bi&#7875;u c&#7843;m c&#7911;a <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> tho&aacute;ng c&#7913;ng &#273;&#7901;.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>A T&ugrave;y.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Trong ti&#7875;u thuy&#7871;t, n&agrave;ng ch&iacute;nh l&agrave; H&#7847;u phu nh&acirc;n <span class=\"q-40d8e30f716847735d39156962b2d222\"><\/span> &#7903; b&ecirc;n Ti&#7871;t Linh &#272;&igrave;nh v&#7887;n v&#7865;n v&agrave;i n&#259;m, <span class=\"b-4d6f234872086089a0781d85234091c8\"><\/span> h&#7891;ng nhan b&#7841;c m&#7879;nh, s&#7899;m l&igrave;a c&otilde;i &#273;&#7901;i.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Th&#7871; nh&#432;ng, d&ugrave; ch&#7881; <span class=\"y-2cf8582475dfb150654494f2255fadcb\"><\/span> v&agrave;i n&#259;m ng&#7855;n ng&#7911;i, n&agrave;ng v&#7851;n sinh con n&#7889;i d&otilde;i cho Ti&#7871;t Linh &#272;&igrave;nh.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>N&agrave;ng gi&uacute;p <span class=\"o-516fa50e42b169126d3b3aaf8301f80c\"><\/span> tho&aacute;t kh&#7887;i c&#417;n &aacute;c m&#7897;ng &#273;eo b&aacute;m t&#7915; thu&#7903; thi&#7871;u th&#7901;i, ch&#7919;a l&agrave;nh nh&#7919;ng v&#7871;t th&#432;&#417;ng ch&#7857;ng ch&#7883;t trong l&ograve;ng <span class=\"o-516fa50e42b169126d3b3aaf8301f80c\"><\/span>. &#272;&#7891;ng th&#7901;i, n&agrave;ng c&#361;ng tr&#7903; th&agrave;nh <span class=\"b-a2e24f318c955cbb09c0da49a4382027\"><\/span> m&agrave; <span class=\"o-516fa50e42b169126d3b3aaf8301f80c\"><\/span> th&#432;&#417;ng nh&#7899; su&#7889;t &#273;&#7901;i, <span class=\"e-a6ee35b4f3eeb6aba6f454e2e8337fd4\"><\/span> t&#7915;ng m&#7897;t <span class=\"y-7ac1d1a525c2c21b5b8b8e6dc9eb8378\"><\/span> qu&ecirc;n l&atilde;ng.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>H&oacute;a <span class=\"n-51911a0eb08b96c08c5ec03f0feb469f\"><\/span> n&agrave;ng <span class=\"m-b40587bae4b414a9ad8227e5eb79a329\"><\/span> xu&#7845;t hi&#7879;n s&#7899;m &#273;&#7871;n <span class=\"b-1047e622bcc6a215de383d9eac22ad35\"><\/span>.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"signature\">[Truy&#7879;n &#273;&#432;&#7907;c &#273;&#259;ng t&#7843;i duy nh&#7845;t t&#7841;i dammy.me - <a href=\"https:\/\/dammyy.cc\/giam-cam-ten-bao-quan-phan-dien\/chuong-2.html\">https:\/\/dammyy.cc\/giam-cam-ten-bao-quan-phan-dien\/chuong-2.html<\/a>.]<\/p><p>7<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ta ngo&#7855;c tay, <span class=\"n-51911a0eb08b96c08c5ec03f0feb469f\"><\/span> hi&#7879;u cho n&agrave;ng ti&#7871;n l&ecirc;n, <span class=\"b-4d6f234872086089a0781d85234091c8\"><\/span> c&#7849;n th&#7853;n quan s&aacute;t m&#7897;t l&#432;&#7907;t.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Qu&#7843; nhi&ecirc;n l&agrave; m&#7897;t m&#7929; nh&acirc;n tuy&#7879;t s&#7855;c, khi&#7871;n k&#7867; <span class=\"q-40d8e30f716847735d39156962b2d222\"><\/span> <span class=\"z-0ebe739a7539a0e44726b3aac2bad2b1\"><\/span> h&#7911;y dung nh&#432; <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> c&#361;ng <span class=\"o-f38a8d70c931cd2181f39edb40684d61\"><\/span> t&#7921; th&#7845;y h&#7893; th&#7865;n.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ta nh&#7899; L&yacute; C&agrave;n t&#7915;ng <span class=\"t-22d7b891db2d67b61f5453c5ac913e88\"><\/span>, t&#7915; thu&#7903; nh&#7887; Ti&#7871;t Linh &#272;&igrave;nh <span class=\"q-40d8e30f716847735d39156962b2d222\"><\/span> <span class=\"y-2cf8582475dfb150654494f2255fadcb\"><\/span> <span class=\"b-a2e24f318c955cbb09c0da49a4382027\"><\/span> trong l&ograve;ng, v&#7851;n lu&ocirc;n nhung nh&#7899; <span class=\"x-41f1d789771b6c968fcc1d63840edfc0\"><\/span> qu&ecirc;n. V&igrave; n&agrave;ng, <span class=\"o-516fa50e42b169126d3b3aaf8301f80c\"><\/span> <span class=\"q-40d8e30f716847735d39156962b2d222\"><\/span> kh&#432;&#7899;c t&#7915; <span class=\"k-5c0675052615b655fc7997ee8ba6eb75\"><\/span> bao ti&#7875;u th&#432; khu&ecirc; c&aacute;c &#7903; kinh th&agrave;nh.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ta th&#7921;c s&#7921; <span class=\"x-41f1d789771b6c968fcc1d63840edfc0\"><\/span> cam l&ograve;ng.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>&#272;&ecirc;m xu&#7889;ng, <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> tri&#7879;u Ti&#7871;t Linh &#272;&igrave;nh &#273;&#7871;n th&#7883; t&#7849;m.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>&ldquo;Ng&#432;&#417;i <span class=\"j-93a75fa0bfabb27ec147380355e89b31\"><\/span> c&#432;&#7899;i n&agrave;ng c&#361;ng <span class=\"r-70db15f955a0d3a4cfa430cd19570962\"><\/span>, nh&#432;ng <span class=\"x-41f1d789771b6c968fcc1d63840edfc0\"><\/span> <span class=\"o-f38a8d70c931cd2181f39edb40684d61\"><\/span> b&acirc;y gi&#7901;.&rdquo;<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ti&#7871;t Linh &#272;&igrave;nh h&#7887;i:<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>&ldquo;B&#7879; h&#7841; &#273;&#7883;nh l&#7845;y g&igrave; &#273;&#7875; ng&#259;n c&#7843;n th&#7847;n?&rdquo;<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>H&#7855;n hi&#7879;n t&#7841;i <span class=\"q-40d8e30f716847735d39156962b2d222\"><\/span> quy&#7873;n khuynh tri&#7873;u d&atilde;, m&#7897;t tay che tr&#7901;i, <span class=\"x-41f1d789771b6c968fcc1d63840edfc0\"><\/span> c&ograve;n l&agrave; v&#7883; Tr&#7841;ng nguy&ecirc;n v&#259;n khoa c&ocirc; &#273;&#7897;c, <span class=\"x-41f1d789771b6c968fcc1d63840edfc0\"><\/span> n&#417;i n&#432;&#417;ng t&#7921;a nh&#432; thu&#7903; ban &#273;&#7847;u n&#7919;a.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ta l&#7845;y <span class=\"n-51911a0eb08b96c08c5ec03f0feb469f\"><\/span> m&#7897;t vi&ecirc;n thu&#7889;c.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>&ldquo;L&#7845;y m&#7841;ng L&yacute; C&agrave;n.&rdquo;<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>S&#7855;c m&#7863;t Ti&#7871;t Linh &#272;&igrave;nh l&#7853;p t&#7913;c <span class=\"g-bb7c1b9ee9a7f03bb69154a1971d4d64\"><\/span> &#273;&#7893;i.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>L&yacute; C&agrave;n t&#7915;ng tr&uacute;ng m&#7897;t lo&#7841;i &#273;&#7897;c, t&ecirc;n l&agrave; Thi&ecirc;n C&acirc;n T&aacute;n.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p><span class=\"d-259bbd38ce734db7006d8a26c3e92126\"><\/span> nh&#432; t&ecirc;n g&#7885;i, m&#7897;t khi &#273;&#7897;c t&iacute;nh ph&aacute;t t&aacute;c <span class=\"m-8a9c4748cee50eb9940c73fbb37c8166\"><\/span> <span class=\"a-3719ff03279ed9b454afb20bfeb41324\"><\/span>, <span class=\"a-3719ff03279ed9b454afb20bfeb41324\"><\/span> b&#7897; kinh m&#7841;ch trong c&#417; th&#7875; s&#7869; &#273;&#7913;t &#273;o&#7841;n, bi&#7871;n th&agrave;nh ph&#7871; nh&acirc;n, s&#7889;ng <span class=\"x-41f1d789771b6c968fcc1d63840edfc0\"><\/span> b&#7857;ng c.h.&#7871;.t.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tr&ecirc;n &#273;&#7901;i <span class=\"u-f86b6c2a36b11ac82469206c7551161f\"><\/span>, ch&#7881; <span class=\"y-2cf8582475dfb150654494f2255fadcb\"><\/span> <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> n&#7855;m gi&#7919; t.h.u.&#7889;.c gi&#7843;i.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ch&iacute;nh nh&#7901; vi&ecirc;n t.h.u.&#7889;.c gi&#7843;i <span class=\"u-1189f2c707b19ca5a66143a54ff28964\"><\/span>, <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> m&#7899;i uy h.i.&#7871;.p <span class=\"r-70db15f955a0d3a4cfa430cd19570962\"><\/span> Ti&#7871;t Linh &#272;&igrave;nh, &eacute;p <span class=\"o-516fa50e42b169126d3b3aaf8301f80c\"><\/span> b&#432;&#7899;c l&ecirc;n long s&agrave;ng.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ch&#7881; c&#7847;n <span class=\"o-516fa50e42b169126d3b3aaf8301f80c\"><\/span> &#7903; b&ecirc;n <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> n&#259;m n&#259;m, m&#7895;i th&aacute;ng <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> s&#7869; d&ugrave;ng t.h.u.&#7889;.c gi&#7843;i ch&#7919;a tr&#7883; cho L&yacute; C&agrave;n, cho &#273;&#7871;n khi <span class=\"o-516fa50e42b169126d3b3aaf8301f80c\"><\/span> <span class=\"m-8a9c4748cee50eb9940c73fbb37c8166\"><\/span> <span class=\"a-3719ff03279ed9b454afb20bfeb41324\"><\/span> b&igrave;nh ph&#7909;c.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p><span class=\"k-eb540db5c0c1cf7daf14e203fb0b8d64\"><\/span> <span class=\"o-516fa50e42b169126d3b3aaf8301f80c\"><\/span> <span class=\"x-41f1d789771b6c968fcc1d63840edfc0\"><\/span> ng&#7901; <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> <span class=\"m-b40587bae4b414a9ad8227e5eb79a329\"><\/span> l&agrave; k&#7867; th&#7845;t t&iacute;n &#273;&#7871;n m&#7913;c <span class=\"u-f86b6c2a36b11ac82469206c7551161f\"><\/span>. B&acirc;y gi&#7901;, <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> c&ograve;n l&#7845;y m&#7841;ng L&yacute; C&agrave;n <span class=\"n-51911a0eb08b96c08c5ec03f0feb469f\"><\/span> uy hi&#7871;p, <span class=\"x-41f1d789771b6c968fcc1d63840edfc0\"><\/span> cho ph&eacute;p <span class=\"o-516fa50e42b169126d3b3aaf8301f80c\"><\/span> th&agrave;nh <span class=\"z-5b86c9d1b53fc1b6246864f9056fdf31\"><\/span>.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>H&#7855;n t&#7913;c &#273;&#7871;n b&#7853;t <span class=\"n-397510de0d2de26bb6a79e002dcb6ffd\"><\/span>, b&oacute;p ch&#7863;t c&#7893; <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span>, khi&#7871;n <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> g&#7847;n nh&#432; <span class=\"i-1fd7c953c1de569aa125c47a110584d6\"><\/span> th&#7845;y ti&#7871;ng x&#432;&#417;ng c&#7889;t r&#259;ng r&#7855;c.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>&ldquo;B&#7879; h&#7841; l&agrave; gi&#7889;ng ch.&oacute; <span class=\"s-53e7ca3ac800c85fb2f52dd652b46536\"><\/span>? &#272;&#432;&#7901;ng &#273;&#432;&#7901;ng l&agrave; ho&agrave;ng &#273;&#7871;, &#273;&#7871;n c&#7843; t&ocirc;n nghi&ecirc;m v&agrave; danh d&#7921; c&#361;ng <span class=\"y-2cf8582475dfb150654494f2255fadcb\"><\/span> th&#7875; v&#7913;t b&#7887;?&rdquo;<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>&ldquo;Nh&#7919;ng th&#7913; &#273;&oacute; &#273;&#7873;u l&agrave; ch.&oacute; m&aacute;. Ch&#7881; c&#7847;n tr&#7851;m <span class=\"y-2cf8582475dfb150654494f2255fadcb\"><\/span> <span class=\"r-70db15f955a0d3a4cfa430cd19570962\"><\/span> th&#7913; <span class=\"x-41327d5f93ec80958d58847dcbcf4cd7\"><\/span> <span class=\"j-93a75fa0bfabb27ec147380355e89b31\"><\/span>, t&#7845;t c&#7843; nh&#7919;ng th&#7913; kh&aacute;c &#273;&#7873;u ch&#7859;ng &#273;&aacute;ng k&#7875;.&rdquo;<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ta ngh&#7865;t th&#7903;, t&#7915; c&#7893; &#273;&#7871;n m&#7863;t &#273;&#7887; b&#7915;ng l&ecirc;n.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Th&#7871; nh&#432;ng, <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> v&#7851;n <span class=\"x-41f1d789771b6c968fcc1d63840edfc0\"><\/span> qu&ecirc;n th&#7903; h&#7893;n h&#7875;n m&agrave; tr&ecirc;u ch&#7885;c <span class=\"o-516fa50e42b169126d3b3aaf8301f80c\"><\/span>:<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>&ldquo;H&#7847;u gia c&#7849;n th&#7853;n. M&#7895;i th&aacute;ng ch&#7881; <span class=\"y-2cf8582475dfb150654494f2255fadcb\"><\/span> duy nh&#7845;t m&#7897;t vi&ecirc;n t.h.u.&#7889;.c gi&#7843;i, v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng qu&yacute; gi&aacute;. N&#7871;u ch&#7859;ng may l&agrave;m r&#417;i m&#7845;t, L&yacute; C&agrave;n s&#7869; <span class=\"o-f38a8d70c931cd2181f39edb40684d61\"><\/span> ch&#7883;u n&#7895;i &#273;au kinh m&#7841;ch &#273;&#7913;t &#273;o&#7841;n &#273;&#7845;y.&rdquo;<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>B&agrave;n tay <span class=\"o-516fa50e42b169126d3b3aaf8301f80c\"><\/span> <span class=\"b-4401c28a16b06f4565af51c37ed423dc\"><\/span> n&#7899;i l&#7887;ng, nh&#432;ng trong m&#7855;t v&#7851;n tr&agrave;n ng&#7853;p v&#7867; ch&aacute;n gh&eacute;t.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>&Aacute;nh m&#7855;t <span class=\"u-1189f2c707b19ca5a66143a54ff28964\"><\/span> ch&#7859;ng kh&aacute;c n&agrave;o m&#7897;t <span class=\"b-a2e24f318c955cbb09c0da49a4382027\"><\/span> v&igrave; m&oacute;n &#273;&#7891; <span class=\"x-41327d5f93ec80958d58847dcbcf4cd7\"><\/span> y&ecirc;u qu&yacute; m&agrave; b&#7845;t &#273;&#7855;c d&#297; <span class=\"o-f38a8d70c931cd2181f39edb40684d61\"><\/span> h&#7841; <span class=\"x-41327d5f93ec80958d58847dcbcf4cd7\"><\/span> <span class=\"j-1feb7ff16ef94c8547de63f1ab3f0723\"><\/span> m&#7897;t con gi&ograve;i.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>H&#7855;n <span class=\"y-2cf8582475dfb150654494f2255fadcb\"><\/span> th&#7875; v&igrave; L&yacute; C&agrave;n m&agrave; h&#7871;t <span class=\"y-7ac1d1a525c2c21b5b8b8e6dc9eb8378\"><\/span> <span class=\"u-f86b6c2a36b11ac82469206c7551161f\"><\/span> &#273;&#7871;n <span class=\"y-7ac1d1a525c2c21b5b8b8e6dc9eb8378\"><\/span> kh&aacute;c nh&#7851;n nh&#7883;n <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span>.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>C&ograve;n vi&#7879;c <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> th&iacute;ch l&agrave;m nh&#7845;t ch&iacute;nh l&agrave; li&ecirc;n t&#7909;c khi&ecirc;u kh&iacute;ch, h&#7871;t <span class=\"y-7ac1d1a525c2c21b5b8b8e6dc9eb8378\"><\/span> <span class=\"u-f86b6c2a36b11ac82469206c7551161f\"><\/span> &#273;&#7871;n <span class=\"y-7ac1d1a525c2c21b5b8b8e6dc9eb8378\"><\/span> kh&aacute;c th&aacute;ch th&#7913;c gi&#7899;i h&#7841;n ch&#7883;u &#273;&#7921;ng c&#7911;a <span class=\"o-516fa50e42b169126d3b3aaf8301f80c\"><\/span>.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>8<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ta <span class=\"y-2cf8582475dfb150654494f2255fadcb\"><\/span> c&#7843; tr&#259;m l&yacute; do &#273;&#7875; g.i.&#7871;.c A T&ugrave;y.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p><span class=\"k-eb540db5c0c1cf7daf14e203fb0b8d64\"><\/span> c&#361;ng <span class=\"x-41f1d789771b6c968fcc1d63840edfc0\"><\/span> th&#7875; qu&aacute; tr&#7855;ng tr&#7907;n.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>N&agrave;ng h&#7859;n ch&iacute;nh l&agrave; b&aacute;u v&#7853;t m&agrave; Ti&#7871;t Linh &#272;&igrave;nh <span class=\"q-40d8e30f716847735d39156962b2d222\"><\/span> t&igrave;m ki&#7871;m su&#7889;t bao n&#259;m. N&#7871;u <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> t&ugrave;y ti&#7879;n g.i.&#7871;.c n&agrave;ng, e r&#7857;ng Ti&#7871;t Linh &#272;&igrave;nh s&#7869; v&igrave; n&agrave;ng m&agrave; n&#7893;i tr&#7853;n l&ocirc;i &#273;&igrave;nh.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ta h&#7841; l&#7879;nh &#273;&#7875; n&agrave;ng l&agrave;m n&#7919; quan <span class=\"z-5b86c9d1b53fc1b6246864f9056fdf31\"><\/span> c&#7853;n b&ecirc;n c&#7841;nh <span class=\"x-41327d5f93ec80958d58847dcbcf4cd7\"><\/span>. Ngo&agrave;i m&#7863;t th&igrave; <span class=\"t-22d7b891db2d67b61f5453c5ac913e88\"><\/span> l&agrave; <span class=\"j-93a75fa0bfabb27ec147380355e89b31\"><\/span> <span class=\"g-bb7c1b9ee9a7f03bb69154a1971d4d64\"><\/span> An Vi&#7877;n H&#7847;u d&#7841;y d&#7895; c&ocirc; th&ocirc;n n&#7919; qu&ecirc; m&ugrave;a, th&#7845;p h&egrave;n <span class=\"u-f86b6c2a36b11ac82469206c7551161f\"><\/span> m&#7897;t phen.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>V&#7889;n &#273;&#7883;nh nh&acirc;n c&#417; h&#7897;i l&agrave;m kh&oacute; n&agrave;ng, n&agrave;o ng&#7901; n&agrave;ng <span class=\"m-b40587bae4b414a9ad8227e5eb79a329\"><\/span> <span class=\"y-2cf8582475dfb150654494f2255fadcb\"><\/span> th&#7875; s&#7855;p x&#7871;p nh&#7919;ng c&ocirc;ng vi&#7879;c n&#7897;i v&#7909; r&#432;&#7901;m r&agrave; nh&#7845;t m&#7897;t c&aacute;ch ng&#259;n n&#7855;p, <span class=\"f-1a13203057dfcfbbba884098049e91c2\"><\/span> <span class=\"n-51911a0eb08b96c08c5ec03f0feb469f\"><\/span> &#273;&#7845;y.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cho d&ugrave; <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> <span class=\"y-2cf8582475dfb150654494f2255fadcb\"><\/span> c&#7889; t&igrave;nh soi m&oacute;i &#273;&#7871;n m&#7913;c n&agrave;o, c&#361;ng ch&#7859;ng th&#7875; t&igrave;m <span class=\"n-51911a0eb08b96c08c5ec03f0feb469f\"><\/span> d&ugrave; ch&#7881; n&#7917;a &#273;i&#7875;m sai s&oacute;t.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Nh&#7919;ng <span class=\"b-a2e24f318c955cbb09c0da49a4382027\"><\/span> v&#7889;n <span class=\"y-2cf8582475dfb150654494f2255fadcb\"><\/span> th&agrave;nh ki&#7871;n v&#7899;i n&agrave;ng, gi&#7901; &#273;&acirc;y &#273;&#7873;u h&#7871;t l&#7901;i khen ng&#7907;i. Ai n&#7845;y &#273;&#7873;u <span class=\"t-22d7b891db2d67b61f5453c5ac913e88\"><\/span> n&agrave;ng xu&#7845;t <span class=\"z-5b86c9d1b53fc1b6246864f9056fdf31\"><\/span> th&#7845;p h&egrave;n, nh&#432;ng qu&#7843; th&#7921;c x&#7913;ng &#273;&ocirc;i v&#7899;i An Vi&#7877;n H&#7847;u.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Kh&ocirc;ng gi&#7889;ng nh&#432; <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span>, <span class=\"h-a0cb9a58bafdb69ae7f2db28b5543e28\"><\/span> t&agrave;n ph&#7871;, <span class=\"h-a0cb9a58bafdb69ae7f2db28b5543e28\"><\/span> <span class=\"v-5969e571156a85276a5ba930e0258236\"><\/span> x&iacute;, <span class=\"m-b40587bae4b414a9ad8227e5eb79a329\"><\/span> ch&#7859;ng <span class=\"r-70db15f955a0d3a4cfa430cd19570962\"><\/span> t&iacute;ch s&#7921; g&igrave;.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>&#272;&ecirc;m xu&#7889;ng, <span class=\"v-38cc84a0083fff9b160e43f2e2457b13\"><\/span> qu&#7845;n l&#7845;y m&aacute;i t&oacute;c &#273;en &oacute;ng nh&#432; g&#7845;m c&#7911;a Ti&#7871;t Linh &#272;&igrave;nh, ch&#7853;m r&atilde;i ngh&#7883;ch t&#7915;ng l&#7885;n.<\/p>\n\n                    <\/div>\n                                        <\/div>\n<\/div>\n","next_chapter":{"storySlug":"giam-cam-ten-bao-quan-phan-dien","chapterSlug":"chuong-3"},"prev_chapter":{"storySlug":"giam-cam-ten-bao-quan-phan-dien","chapterSlug":"chuong-1"},"chapterName":"Ch\u01b0\u01a1ng 2.","stringSlug":"giam-cam-ten-bao-quan-phan-dien,chuong-2","url":"https:\/\/dammyy.cc\/giam-cam-ten-bao-quan-phan-dien\/chuong-2.html","storySlug":"giam-cam-ten-bao-quan-phan-dien","viewToken":"hmtd2Hyli6VxM8t0V99rv8JtTerjD0kLKyALJ8OB","viewDelay":105000,"csrfToken":"zq9esiTWe17ATJkolRv5oGNNMhlrDhwW78W9TSEh"}